WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:25.714
EPA 608 is not optional. You cannot legally touch refrigerant without it. Let's
make sure you pass.

00:00:25.714 --> 00:00:51.429
Since January 2018 only EPA 608 certified technicians can purchase refrigerant
including HFCs like R-410A. This applies to all container sizes. Sellers must
verify certification before selling. Records of sales must be maintained. This

00:00:51.429 --> 00:01:17.143
Here are the key terms. Write these down.

00:01:17.143 --> 00:01:42.857
Sales Restriction: Only EPA 608 certified technicians can purchase any
refrigerant since 2018.

00:01:42.857 --> 00:02:08.571
Here's why this matters on the job: Without your EPA 608 card you cannot buy
refrigerant. Period.

00:02:08.571 --> 00:02:34.286
Watch out for these: Applies to ALL refrigerants including HFCs. And — Applies
to ALL container sizes

